{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003346","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003346"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003346","label":"孝惠帝（曹相國世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"孝惠帝","mention_ids":["c-shiji-054-cao:m009-0000"]},{"surface":"惠帝","mention_ids":["c-shiji-054-cao:m010-0000","c-shiji-054-cao:m015-0008","c-shiji-054-cao:m015-0134","c-shiji-054-cao:m015-0263"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m009-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p009","quote":"孝惠帝"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m010-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p010","quote":"惠帝"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m015-0008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p015","quote":"惠帝"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m015-0134","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p015","quote":"惠帝"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m015-0263","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p015","quote":"惠帝"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m009-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孝惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003346","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003346","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p010","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m015-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003346","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m015-0134","start":134,"end":136,"surface":"惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003346","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m015-0263","start":263,"end":265,"surface":"惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003346","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji054-040","person_id":"cbr-p003346","surfaces":["孝惠帝","惠帝"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-054-cao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p009","quote":"孝惠帝元年，除諸侯相國法，更以參為齊丞相。參之相齊，齊七十城。天下初定，悼惠王富於春秋，參盡召長老諸生，問所以安集百姓，如齊故［俗］諸儒以百數，言人人殊，參未知所定。聞膠西有蓋公，善治黃老言，使人厚幣請之。既見蓋公，蓋公為言治道貴清靜而民自定，推此類具言之。參於是避正堂，舍蓋公焉。其治要用黃老術，故相齊九年，齊國安集，大稱賢相。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p010","quote":"惠帝二年，蕭何卒。參聞之，告舍人趣治行，「吾將入相」。居無何，使者果召參。參去，屬其後相曰：「以齊獄市為寄，慎勿擾也。」後相曰：「治無大於此者乎？」參曰：「不然。夫獄市者，所以并容也，今君擾之，姦人安所容也？吾是以先之。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p015","quote":"參子窋為中大夫。惠帝怪相國不治事，以為「豈少朕與」？乃謂窋曰：「若歸，試私從容問而父曰：『高帝新棄群臣，帝富於春秋，君為相，日飲，無所請事，何以憂天下乎？』然無言吾告若也。」窋既洗沐歸，窋侍，自從其所諫參。參怒，而笞窋二百，曰：「趣入侍，天下事非若所當言也。」至朝時，惠帝讓參曰：「與窋胡治乎？乃者我使諫君也。」參免冠謝曰：「陛下自察聖武孰與高帝？」上曰：「朕乃安敢望先帝乎！」曰：「陛下觀臣能孰與蕭何賢？」上曰：「君似不及也。」參曰：「陛下言之是也。且高帝與蕭何定天下，法令既明，今陛下垂拱，參等守職，遵而勿失，不亦可乎？」惠帝曰：「善。君休矣！」"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名與局部軍事、任官及子嗣敘事暫接；曹氏時、襄不按單字全域配對。未名者不補姓名，秦司馬夷字待底本核定，田既與田溉不擅同指。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p009","text":"孝惠帝元年，除諸侯相國法，更以參為齊丞相。參之相齊，齊七十城。天下初定，悼惠王富於春秋，參盡召長老諸生，問所以安集百姓，如齊故［俗］諸儒以百數，言人人殊，參未知所定。聞膠西有蓋公，善治黃老言，使人厚幣請之。既見蓋公，蓋公為言治道貴清靜而民自定，推此類具言之。參於是避正堂，舍蓋公焉。其治要用黃老術，故相齊九年，齊國安集，大稱賢相。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m009-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孝惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003346","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m009-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"參","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003307","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m